### Try the gateway (VS Code REST Client, Rider, or Visual Studio)
# 1. Sign in to the admin console, open Contoso Ltd, issue a key with scope orders.read.
# 2. Paste the key below.

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@key = apim_REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_KEY

### Public route: no key needed
GET {{gateway}}/public/status

### No key: 401 with a problem+json body
GET {{gateway}}/api/echo/hello

### Valid key: the backend echoes what it received (tenant ID, no raw key)
GET {{gateway}}/api/echo/hello?x=1
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Authorization: Bearer user-token-from-your-auth-service

### Scoped route: 403 unless the key has orders.read
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/42
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Readiness: shows how many routes are loaded
GET {{gateway}}/health/ready
